00:30:06,090 --> 00:30:08,460
So you talked a lot about how Google

773
00:30:08,460 --> 00:30:12,570
is responding to environmental impacts

774
00:30:12,570 --> 00:30:15,900
and helping to mitigate things like flooding and fires.

