00:30:15,900 --> 00:30:19,950
Can you talk a little bit about AI solutions

776
00:30:19,950 --> 00:30:23,340
and scaling AI solutions

777
00:30:23,340 --> 00:30:27,120
that can help with climate,

778
00:30:27,120 --> 00:30:29,883
help to reduce the climate impacts of AI?

