00:30:40,313 --> 00:30:43,590
And yeah, it's something we think a lot about.

786
00:30:43,590 --> 00:30:44,580
Maybe just starting there

787
00:30:44,580 --> 00:30:46,230
and then I'll get into solutions.

788
00:30:47,460 --> 00:30:49,710
One of the pieces that Google released recently

789
00:30:49,710 --> 00:30:51,000
was an analysis

